<strong>Style:</strong> Sonoran desert contemporary with German precision</p>

<p>Weeks &amp; Mitchell took a soaring, light-filled Scottsdale great room and gave it a kitchen with real weight to it — two flat, modern Pronorm finishes set against a waterfall of dramatic veined stone. The pairing is <strong>Dark Steel</strong> on the tall runs, bases, and perimeter, and <strong>Ultra Matte Black Lacquer</strong> on the wall cabinets. It's a clinic in how to use German cabinetry to carry a big, vaulted room without making it feel cold.</p>

